				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2011-11-04T14:14:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『空気が　重たい……
早く　決着を　つけないと▽
とりこまれる　危険が……
</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2011-11-04T14:14:46" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2011-11-04T14:14:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
	</TextRow>
